.* CMDPRBMGT: Problem Management Commands, a group of the major command menu.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDPRBMGT'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDPRBMGT HELP=HLPCMDPRBMGT KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Problem Management Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?CHGSRVA'.
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?DSPSRVA'.
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Related Command Menus
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU CMDALR'.Alert Commands  CMDALR
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT4' OPTION=4 ACTION='MENU CMDCPYSCN'.Copy Screen Commands  CMDCPYSCN
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT5' OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU CMDDBG'.Debug Commands  CMDDBG
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT6' OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU CMDDMP'.Dump Commands  CMDDMP
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT7' OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU CMDFTR'.Filter Commands  CMDFTR
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT8' OPTION=8 ACTION='MENU CMDMSGHDL'.Message Handling Commands  CMDMSGHDL
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='MENU CMDPRB'.Problem Commands  CMDPRB
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU CMDPTF'.Program Temporary Fix Commands  CMDPTF
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='MENU CMDRCY'.Recovery Commands  CMDRCY
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT12' OPTION=12 ACTION='MENU CMDSRV'.Service Commands  CMDSRV
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT13' OPTION=13 ACTION='MENU CMDSST'.System Service Tools Commands  CMDSST
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT14' OPTION=14 ACTION='MENU CMDTRC'.Trace Commands  CMDTRC
:MENUI HELP='CMDPRBMGT/OPT15' OPTION=15 ACTION='MENU CMDWRKMGT'.Work Management Commands  CMDWRKMGT
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDPRBMGT.Problem Management Commands - Help
:P.Problem Management Commands: the commands and the command menus of this
group, as the major command menu arranges them, with each name at the
right of its row. A blank row is a command this release does not
provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command or show the
menu, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous
menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command
groups.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows menu MAJOR.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDPRBMGT/OPT3'.Alert Commands  CMDALR
:P.Option 3. Shows menu CMDALR&colon. Alert Commands CMDALR.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDPRBMGT/OPT4'.Copy Screen Commands  CMDCPYSCN
:P.Option 4. Shows menu CMDCPYSCN&colon. Copy Screen Commands CMDCPYSCN.
:EHELP.
